            "description": "",
            "summary": "On September 22, 2025, Reitar Logtech Holdings Limited announced that it had formally signed a strategic MoU and investment agreement with AI logistics firm NEXX for the development of a Smart Fulfillment Center in Milaha Logistics City, Doha, Qatar, with backing from Solomon Capital Fund under Solowin Holdings. This initiative highlights Reitar's commitment to next-generation logistics by integrating Agentic AI management, automated robotics, and exploring asset tokenization, supporting...",
